{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"604","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. More Cowbell"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Kevin Sun wants to move his precious collection of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cowbells from Naperthrill to Exeter, where there is actually grass instead of corn. Before moving, he must pack his cowbells into "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" boxes of a fixed size. In order to keep his collection safe during transportation, he won't place more than "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"two"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" cowbells into a single box. Since Kevin wishes to minimize expenses, he is curious about the smallest size box he can use to pack his entire collection. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Kevin is a meticulous cowbell collector and knows that the size of his "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") cowbell is an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"si"},{"kind":"text","text":". In fact, he keeps his cowbells sorted by size, so "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"si - 1 ≤ si"},{"kind":"text","text":" for any "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i > 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". Also an expert packer, Kevin can fit one or two cowbells into a box of size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" if and only if the sum of their sizes does not exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":". Given this information, help Kevin determine the smallest "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" for which it is possible to put all of his cowbells into "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" boxes of size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 2·k ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting the number of cowbells and the number of boxes, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s1, s2, ..., sn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ s1 ≤ s2 ≤ ... ≤ sn ≤ 1 000 000"},{"kind":"text","text":"), the sizes of Kevin's cowbells. It is guaranteed that the sizes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"si"},{"kind":"text","text":" are given in non-decreasing order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer, the smallest "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" for which it is possible for Kevin to put all of his cowbells into "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" boxes of size "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 1\n2 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3\n2 3 5 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"9\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2\n3 5 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"8\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, Kevin must pack his two cowbells into the same box. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample, Kevin can pack together the following sets of cowbells: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"{2, 3}"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"{5}"},{"